    description: "profile.languages does not include tlaplus even when a repo has hundreds of .tla files. The TLA+ analyzer correctly discovers and analyzes .tla files (6062 nodes in tlaplus/examples), but the profile/LOC detection system doesn't map .tla extension to a language. This causes the sketch Overview line to omit TLA+ entirely. Root cause is likely the file extension -> language mapping in discovery.py or profile detection code. Found during real-world repo validation on 2026-04-09. See ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tla_realworld_validation_04092026.md."  # 3938
